---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Multi-Layer Sketch DXF Export Support"
  description="Support for the Multi-Layer Sketch DXF Export add-in for Autodesk Fusion."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="support-page">
    <section class="support-shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to Kenzap</a>
      <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
      <h1>Multi-Layer Sketch DXF Export support</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Get help with exporting Fusion sketches to DXF files with separate CUT and MARK layers.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="card-label">Local export</div>
          <div class="card-title">Your files stay on your device</div>
          <p>
            The add-in creates DXF files locally. Only send a design file, DXF, or screenshot if you
            would like us to review it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card accent">
          <div class="card-label">Useful report details</div>
          <div class="card-title">Help us reproduce it</div>
          <p>
            Include your Fusion version, operating system, add-in version, steps to reproduce, and
            any relevant Fusion error message.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="faq-section">
        <div class="section-label">Frequently asked questions</div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details open>
            <summary>What does the add-in export?</summary>
            <p>
              It exports the active or visible Fusion sketch as a DXF. Regular sketch entities are
              placed on the CUT layer and construction geometry is placed on the MARK layer.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Which details should I include in a bug report?</summary>
            <p>
              Include your Fusion version, operating system, add-in version, the steps you took,
              the expected result, and what happened instead. A screenshot of an error is helpful.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can I send a Fusion design or DXF file?</summary>
            <p>
              Yes, but only if you are comfortable sharing it. Describe the issue first; we will
              let you know if a sample file would help investigate it.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do you publish user questions?</summary>
            <p>
              Only with your explicit permission. The form includes an optional checkbox allowing us
              to turn the question into an edited FAQ without personal details.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="form" class="form-section">
        <div class="section-label">Contact support</div>
        <form
          name="fusion-dxf-export-support"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-recaptcha="true"
          netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          action="/thank-you"
          class="support-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="fusion-dxf-export-support" />
          <input type="hidden" name="product" value="Multi-Layer Sketch DXF Export" />
          <p class="honeypot">
            <label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <div class="field-grid">
            <label>
              <span>Name</span>
              <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Email</span>
              <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="field-grid">
            <label>
              <span>Operating system</span>
              <input type="text" name="environment" placeholder="Example: macOS 15 or Windows 11" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Fusion version</span>
              <input type="text" name="fusionVersion" placeholder="Example: 2.0.21000" />
            </label>
          </div>

          <label>
            <span>Add-in version</span>
            <input type="text" name="version" placeholder="Example: 1.0.0" />
          </label>

          <label>
            <span>Your question</span>
            <textarea
              name="message"
              rows="8"
              placeholder="Describe the issue, expected result, and steps to reproduce it."
              required
            ></textarea>
          </label>

          <label class="checkbox-row">
            <input type="checkbox" name="publishConsent" value="yes" />
            <span>I give permission for Kenzap to publish this question in edited FAQ form without personal details.</span>
          </label>

          <div class="captcha-wrap" data-netlify-recaptcha="true"></div>

          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send request →</button>
            <div class="form-note">
              Your message is submitted through Netlify Forms. You can also email
              <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a>.
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    const setField = (name: string, keys: string[]) => {
      const value = keys.map((key) => params.get(key)).find(Boolean);
      const field = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[name="${name}"]`);

      if (field && value) field.value = value;
    };

    setField('environment', ['environment', 'platform', 'os']);
    setField('fusionVersion', ['fusionVersion', 'fusion_version']);
    setField('version', ['version', '_version', 'appVersion']);
  </script>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background: #f6f7fc;
      color: #0a0a08;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .support-page { min-height: 100vh; padding: 48px 24px 96px; }
    .support-shell { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px; border: 1px solid #dde1f0; background: rgba(246, 247, 252, 0.94); }
    .back-link, .eyebrow, .section-label, .card-label, .form-note { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; }
    .back-link { display: inline-flex; margin-bottom: 28px; color: #4a4f5c; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .back-link:hover { color: #0a0a08; }
    .eyebrow, .section-label, .card-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .eyebrow, .section-label { color: #1941df; }
    .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    h1, .card-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0a0a08; }
    h1 { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 0.98; }
    .intro { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 36px; font-size: 18px; color: #4a4f5c; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; margin-bottom: 48px; border: 1px solid #dde1f0; background: #dde1f0; }
    .hero-card { padding: 28px; background: #f6f7fc; }
    .hero-card.accent { background: #0a0a08; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); }
    .hero-card.accent .card-label { color: #7b9af5; }
    .hero-card.accent .card-title, .hero-card.accent a { color: #f6f7fc; }
    .card-label { margin-bottom: 12px; color: #8a9099; }
    .card-title { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.05; }
    .faq-section, .form-section { margin-top: 40px; }
    .faq-list { margin-top: 18px; border: 1px solid #dde1f0; background: #dde1f0; }
    details { background: #f6f7fc; }
    details + details { border-top: 1px solid #dde1f0; }
    summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: 20px 24px; font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.15; }
    details p { padding: 0 24px 20px; color: #4a4f5c; font-size: 15px; }
    .support-form { margin-top: 18px; padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #dde1f0; background: #f6f7fc; }
    .honeypot { display: none; }
    .field-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    label { display: block; margin-top: 18px; }
    label span { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4a4f5c; }
    input, textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #dde1f0; border-radius: 0; background: #fff; color: #0a0a08; font: inherit; padding: 14px 16px; }
    textarea { resize: vertical; }
    .checkbox-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 22px; }
    .checkbox-row input { width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-top: 2px; padding: 0; flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .checkbox-row span { margin: 0; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; color: #4a4f5c; }
    .captcha-wrap { margin-top: 22px; }
    .form-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .submit-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 14px 28px; border: 0; border-radius: 2px; background: #0a0a08; color: #f6f7fc; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.04em; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s; }
    .submit-btn:hover { background: #1941df; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .form-note { max-width: 420px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #8a9099; }
    a { color: #0a0a08; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .hero-grid, .field-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .support-page { padding: 24px 16px 72px; } .support-shell, .support-form { padding: 32px 24px; } summary { padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 17px; } details p { padding: 0 20px 18px; } }
  </style>
</Layout>
